    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, thats not really a summary of the debate, its more like an argument for one side. can u try again but make it more neutral? like, actually present the arguments for why someone might argue against a rapid phase-out. i want to show that there are real concerns about energy security and the impact on lower income families.",
